      "content": "rebuild? how? i'm 29. i've spent my entire adult life on this. everyone in the department thinks i'm some kind of prodigy and now i'm just... i'm a joke. i can't go back to the lab. i can't look them in the eye knowing i've wasted everyone's time and my own. it feels like there's no version of the future where i'm not just a massive disappointment. it feels like the path just... ended.",
